      "props": {
        "layoutVariant": "asymmetric-split",
        "title": "Our Journey",
        "story": "At Sarvottam, we're passionate about crafting exceptional coffee experiences. Our journey began with a simple yet bold vision: to source the finest specialty beans and roast them to perfection, bringing out the unique flavors and characteristics of each bean. Our expert baristas are dedicated to the art of coffee making, ensuring every cup is a masterpiece.",
